cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "weno_singular"
abstract: >-
  WENO solvers for linear hyperbolic conservation laws with singular source
  terms. Python implementations of the WENO3, WENO5 (Jiang-Shu) and WENO-Z
  (Borges et al.) finite-volume reconstructions for 1D linear scalar advection
  on uniform meshes, with explicit (SSP-RK3) and semi-implicit
  (RK3 + Crank-Nicolson) time integration, built-in support for Dirac-delta
  point sources, and explicit control over source placement when the
  singularity coincides with a cell interface.
